<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details select Q1 operating stats.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details select Q1 operating stats.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported 1996 select operating statistics. Figures where not stated are in average thousands of barrels per day.</p>
<p>    Item				 Q1 1996	  Q1 1997</p>
<p>Output</p>
<p>    Total Liquid Hydrocarbons     3,304	    3,331</p>
<p>	Crude Oil			 2,836	    2,958</p>
<p>	Condensates and Liquid Gas    468		373</p>
<p>    Natural Gas (mln cfd)	   4,235	    4,347</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products		1,547	    1,483</p>
<p>    Petrochemicals (000 tonnes)   3,701	    3,059</p>
<p>Domestic Sales</p>
<p>    Petroleum, Natgas Products    1,726	    1,766</p>
<p>	Liquified Petroleum Gas (LPG) 284		286</p>
<p>	Gasoline			    475		488</p>
<p>	Jet Fuel			     47		 49</p>
<p>	Diesel				238		251</p>
<p>	Industrial Fuels		  654		664</p>
<p>	  Fuel Oil			  415		420</p>
<p>	  Natural Gas*		    233		238</p>
<p>	  Gas Oil			     5		  5</p>
<p>    Others				   29		 29</p>
<p>    Petrochemicals (000 tonnes)   1,482	    1,474</p>
<p>International Trade</p>
<p>    Crude Oil Exports		 1,484	    1,613</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products		 -130	     -203</p>
<p>	Exports				31		 32</p>
<p>	Imports			     160		235</p>
<p>    Net Natgas Exports (mln cfd)     -5		 17</p>
<p>Net Petrochemical Exports</p>
<p>	 (000 tonnes)		     238		117</p>
<p>Legend: *is the fuel oil equivalent.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
<p>E-mail at timna.tanners@reuters.com</p>
